{"id":"hahn","lemma":"Hahn","pos":"noun","rank":3652,"glosses":["cock, rooster"],"ipa":"/haːn/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/b6/De-Hahn.OGG/De-Hahn.OGG.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Hahns","plural":"Hähne"},"formAudio":{"Hahns":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a1/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Hahns.wav","Hähne":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/90/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-H%C3%A4hne.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Der Hahn kräht.","en":"The rooster is crowing.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/759467","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to crow","l":"krähen"}]},{"text":"Ich habe viele Hennen, aber keinen Hahn.","en":"I have a lot of hens, but I don't have a rooster.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"much, a lot","l":"viel"},{"g":"hen","l":"Henne"},{"g":"but"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},null]},{"text":"Danach kräht kein Hahn.","en":"No one cares about that.","words":[{"g":"after it, after that"},{"g":"to crow","l":"krähen"},{"g":"no / not a"},null]},{"text":"Repariere den Hahn in der Küche!","en":"Fix the tap in the kitchen.","words":[{"g":"to repair","l":"reparieren"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},null,{"g":"in"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"kitchen"}]},{"text":"Ich habe den Hahn zugedreht.","en":"I turned off the tap.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},null,null]}]}